-- =========================================================================
-- VERIFICATION COMMENT
-- =========================================================================
-- This migration fixes P0 Gate 0 violations in real-estate tables.
-- Before: USING (true) allowed cross-tenant data access
-- After: Strict tenant_id filtering enforced
--
-- Business Impact:
--   - Prevents competitor pricing visibility
--   - Prevents inventory leakage
--   - Maintains commercial confidentiality
--
-- Security Impact:
--   - Satisfies Gate 0 constitutional requirement
--   - Prevents multi-tenant data leakage
-- =========================================================================
